@startuml audio_edit_proving_protocol

hide footbox

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 210
skinparam ParticipantPadding 30
skinparam BoxPadding 20

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #3D4451
  ArrowFontColor #3D4451
  ArrowFontSize 11
  ArrowThickness 1.2

  LifeLineBorderColor #3D4451
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F7F8FA

  ParticipantBorderColor #3D4451
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ParticipantFontColor #1A1D23
  ParticipantFontSize 13
  ParticipantFontStyle bold
  ParticipantPadding 20

  DividerBackgroundColor #d2e2f2
  DividerBorderColor #d2e2f2
  DividerBorderThickness 0
  DividerFontColor #1A1D23
  DividerFontSize 11
  DividerFontStyle bold
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FBFBFC
  BorderColor #D8DDE4
  BorderThickness 1
  FontColor #4A5160
  FontSize 10
}

skinparam title {
  FontSize 15
  FontColor #1A1D23
  FontStyle bold
  BorderThickness 0
}

' title Verifiable Audio Editing Protocol

participant "**Attesting Device**\n//Signer//" as D
participant "**Editor**\n//Prover//" as P
participant "**User**\n//Verifier//" as V

== Signature Setup ==

rnote over D : **(priv_k, pub_k) ← KeyGen(1^λ)**
D --> V : <color:#1A1D23>**pub_k**</color>
note right of D
  priv_k held in tamper-resistant hardware;
  pub_k published via manufacturer trust list
end note

== Attested capture ==

rnote over D : capture audio stream α
rnote over D : h_α ← accumulate H over α
rnote over D : wav_α ← Encode(α)
rnote over D : **σ ← Sign(priv_k, h_α)**
D -> P : <color:#1A1D23>**wav_α, σ**</color>

== Edit ==

rnote over P : (α, f_s, b) ← Decode(wav_α)
rnote over P : **β ← F(α; θ)**
' note right of P
'   Applied off-circuit and F and θ are public.
' end note
rnote over P : wav_β ← Encode(β)

== Parse ==

rnote over P : E_α ← Parse(α, b, B)
rnote over P : E_β ← Parse(β, b, B)
' note right of P
'   k = ⌊U/b⌋ samples per field
'   element; B samples per batch,
'   c = ⌈n/B⌉ batches
' end note

== Prove ==

rnote over P : **(π, h_α, h_β) ← Prove(E_α, E_β, F, θ)**
note over P
  Folded by IVC and compressed to a 
  succinct π. E_α and E_β remain private.
end note

P -> V : <color:#1A1D23>**wav_β, π, σ, h_α, F, θ**</color>

== Verify ==

rnote over V : (β, f_s, b) ← Decode(wav_β)
rnote over V : h*_β ← accumulate H over β
rnote over V : **v_π ← Verify_π(π, h_α, h*_β, F, θ)**
rnote over V : **v_σ ← Verify_Σ(pub_k, h_α, σ)**
rnote over V : **Accepts ↔ v_π AND v_σ**

note over D, V
  **v_π** — β is the edited output of some recording of digest h_α under F;

  **v_σ** — a recording of digest h_α was emitted by the device pub_k;

  **Implication** — the conjunction binds the published edited recording, β, to an attested capture;
  the original recording, α, itself is never transmitted.
end note

@enduml